!.git/refs/heads/**

# Credentials. This file is gitignored, so a CI build never sees it, but a local
# build would otherwise bake the real battery, meter and API credentials into an
# image that may be pushed to a public registry.
**/secrets.json
**/appsettings.Development.json

# Nothing below is needed to build the app, and databases must never be baked
# into an image that gets published.
db
Sql
TestResults
.abacusai
**/*.db
